# Internal project files that live in the repo root (deploy source) but must
# never be served publicly. Rewritten to the SPA shell with a 404 status —
# any config/schema/script file added here later is covered automatically
# by the directory-level rules, only new root-level files need a new line.
# The trailing "!" forces the rule to win over the real static asset that
# would otherwise be served in preference to any redirect rule.
/wrangler.toml / 404!
/PRIVACY.md / 404!
/ROADMAP_PLAYSTORE.md / 404!
/migrations / 404!
/migrations/* / 404!
/scripts / 404!
/scripts/* / 404!
/worker / 404!
/worker/* / 404!
